HHIISSTTOORRYY
       This  utility  is  not  provided by other implementations.  There is no
       relevant X/Open or POSIX standard for ttooee.

       The program name refers to a developer's pun:

       •   ttiicc,

       •   ttaacc (now ttaacckk),

       •   ttooee.

       It replaced a --TT option which was briefly supported by the ncurses  iinn‐‐
       ffooccmmpp utility in 1995.

       The  --aa  and --ss options were added to ttooee several years later (2006 and
       2011, respectively).

